  "description": "A convention-based object-object mapper for .NET. Flattening, unflattening (ReverseMap), profiles, value resolvers, type converters, value converters, conditions, before/after map actions, inheritance (Include/IncludeBase), constructor mapping, collections, dictionaries, enums, IQueryable projection (ProjectTo), configuration validation and Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection integration. Also built in: collection merging by key (EqualityComparison), PATCH-style mapping that ignores null source values, strict enum mapping with validation, immutable collections, full member paths in error messages and Explain() for inspecting maps.",
